#. y1:english="I'm sorry, Kazuma-san.\nI didn't expect something like this||to happen while I was out.\nNo need to be sorry.\nI'm more worried about Detective Date.\nI never imagined that Saya||would run up a tab at our bar...\nNow I realise Shota's \"Advance\"||was for that purpose.\n\"Advance\"?\nYeah,{PA:10} He got an advance on his pay.\n...Some hosts do that to pay off||their customers' debt.\n...The hosts have to get the customers||to pay them back though.\nSo, you're saying Shota borrowed||money to help...\nNo.{PA:10} I don't think that's the reason.\n...Because our bar never adds any interest||nor sets deadlines on an \"Advance\".\nWhere's Shota now?\nHe had the early shift today,||so he's already gone."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0084.BIN:64_0_13
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0084.BIN::line:64_0_13"
msgid "o fecha tope a los \"Adelantos\"."
msgstr ""

